# docs/ — distribution-grade artifacts are tracked; only true local state is ignored.
# Rationale: see docs/MEMORY_AND_HANDOFF.md (mémoire officielle vs conversation).

# Local session memory (per-machine, never versioned — gitignored by design)
docs/SESSION.md
docs/SESSION.*.md

# Local-only overlay subfolder (anything user-specific or sensitive)
docs/local/

# Pi local state (agent-specific, not for distribution)
.pi/

# Runtime contract traces (generated locally, not for distribution)
docs/audits/vbb-runtime/

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
.vbb/

# Python generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
